1) Zainab sifat behen thi Imame raza ki bhi<br>
Jo beqaraar rehti thi furqat me bhai ki <br>
Bhai ke hi qayaal me din raat roti thi <br>
Masooma Qum ke naam se mashhoor hogayi <br>
<br>
Yasrab me thi firaaq ki ghadiyaa'n sahe huwe <br>
Muddat huwi thi bhai ko iraa'n gaye huwe <br>
