2) Bhai behen me fitri mohabbat quda ne di <br>
Nemat bashar ko ye karame kibriya ne di <br>
Khooe wafa jahan ko rabbe ulaa ne di <br>
Khaslat wila ki khaliqe ahle wila ne di <br>
<br>
Dil me behen hai bhai ki ulfat liye huwe <br>
Bhai bhi hai behen ki mohabbat liye huwe <br>
____________________________<br>
3) Kehti thi kab watan ko mere bhai aaoge<br>
Kab aake mujhko chehrae anwar dikhaoge <br>
Apni behen ko apni sada kab sunaoge <br>
Aate nahi agar to mujhe kab bulaoge <br>
<br>
Marti hu mai ajal ke barabar hai zindagi <br>
Bhai baghair aapke do bhar hai zindagi <br>
____________________________<br>
4) Hai beqaraar aapki gham khaar bhai jaan<br>
Aankhen hai ab firaaq me khoo'n baar bhai jaan<br>
Nazro me hai wo aap ki raftar bhai jaan<br>
Aati hai yaad aapki guftaar bhai jaan<br>
<br>
Jalwa figan hai qalb me tanveer aap ki<br>
Phirti hai meri aankhon me tasweer aap ki<br>
____________________________<br>
5) Bhai mera har ek nafas nauha khan hai<br>
Zindaan me firaaq ke mehboos jaan hai<br>
Andher meri chashm me sara jahan hai<br>
Ghar me nahi hai aap toh khali makaan hai<br>
<br>
Tashreef laake qalb mera shaad kijiye<br>
Sunsaan is makaan ko abaad kijiye<br>
____________________________<br>
6) Aati thi is behen ko kabhi karbala ki yaad<br>
Abbas ke qayaal me aayi wafa ki yaad<br>
Ek mehshar qayaal thi shaahe huda ki yaad<br>
Tasweer e khoo'n thi Qasim e gulgoo'n qaba ki yaad<br>
<br>
Is tarha is behen ko baradar ki yaad thi<br>
Sughra ko jis tarha Ali Akbar ki yaad thi<br>
____________________________<br>
7) Rumaal apna karti thi ye aansuo'n se tar<br>
Soze firaaq se huwe sozaa'n dil o jigar<br>
Karti thi umr hasrate deedaar me basar<br>
Aakhir ko ek roz huwi aazime safar<br>
<br>
Furqat me zabt ho na saka bas nikal padhi<br>
Iraa'n ki simt apne watan se ye chal padhi<br>
____________________________<br>
8) Pohnchi hai shehre qum ke qaree'n jab ye qasta jaa'n<br>
Aaya waha'n nigaah me is ki ajab samaa'n<br>
Yaani siyaah posh hai sab log nauha khaa'n<br>
Karte hai apna seena o sar peet kar fughaa'n<br>
<br>
Pehne huwe libaas hai sab ehle gham siyaah<br>
Basti ke har makaan pa dekha alam siyaah<br>
