13) Bekas ye iske baad hi bistar nashee'n huwi<br>
Bhai ka daagh dil pa tha do bhar thi zindagi<br>
Din raat yaad karke baradar ko roti thi<br>
Kuch roz aise haal hi me zindagi gayi<br>
<br>
Dukh badhgaya jo zabt ki had ke nashaan se<br>
Bhai ke gham me chal basi aakhir jahaan se<br>
